s Handwerker","role":"Voce di Gregor"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Autunno 1943. La berlinese Rosa Sauer, insieme ad altre sei donne, viene costretta ad assaggiare il cibo destinato ad Adolf Hitler con lo scopo di verificare che non sia avvelenato. Divise tra la paura di morire e la fame, le sette assaggiatrici stringeranno tra loro alleanze, amicizie e patti segreti.","tagline":"Ogni pasto poteva essere l'ultimo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Tasters","overview":"In autumn 1943, in Gross-Partsch, 26-year-old Rosa, who had come from Berlin to stay with the parents of her husband Gregor, who was fighting on the Russian front, was taken by the SS to a mysterious place. Forced to taste a dish, she joins the group of tasters responsible for checking that the food destined for Hitler is not poisoned.","tagline":"Every meal could be their last."},{"language":"de-DE","title":"Die Vorkosterinnen","overview":"Die Berlinerin Rosa Sauer wird zusammen mit sechs anderen Frauen gezwungen, Lebensmittel zu verkosten, die für Adolf Hitler bestimmt sind. So soll gewährleistet werden, dass der Führer kein vergiftetes Essen serviert bekommt. Hin- und hergerissen zwischen Todesangst und Hunger schließen die Frauen Bündnisse und Freundschaften. Alles ändert sich jedoch, als der neue Kommandant Albert Ziegler vor Ort seinen Dienst antritt und ein Klima der Angst schafft."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hjjPe2rQINX18JvS0EiWfxlJaFg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wAow3w58FGNdWUMpPdddOtnM3A0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1291712,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hjjPe2rQINX18JvS0EiWfxlJaFg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.o